weavec — Self-Hosted Weave Compiler
Copyright 2026 Jukka Aho

This product includes software developed as the user-facing compiler for the
Weave programming language. It is written in surface Weave and combines surface
lowering with WIR-to-LLVM emission.

The repository was formerly named `weavec2`.

